卫星绕地球做匀速圆周运动，万有引力提供向心力 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="G rac{Mm}{r^{2}}=m\omega^{2}r=m rac{v^{2}}{r}" data-display="0">G rac{Mm}{r^{2}}=m\omega^{2}r=m rac{v^{2}}{r}</span>，<br><br>其中 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="G" data-display="0">G</span> 为引力常量，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="M" data-display="0">M</span> 为地球质量，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="r" data-display="0">r</span> 为轨道半径，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="\omega" data-display="0">\omega</span> 为角速度，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="v" data-display="0">v</span> 为线速度。<br><br>推导得 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="v=\sqrt{ rac{GM}{r}}" data-display="0">v=\sqrt{ rac{GM}{r}}</span>，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="\omega=\sqrt{ rac{GM}{r^{3}}}" data-display="0">\omega=\sqrt{ rac{GM}{r^{3}}}</span>，<br><br>A．由 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="v=\omega r" data-display="0">v=\omega r</span>，由于轨道半径不同，则 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="v_{1}/\omega_{1}
eq v_{2}/\omega_{2}" data-display="0">v_{1}/\omega_{1}
eq v_{2}/\omega_{2}</span>，故 A 错误；<br><br>B．由以上分析可知，<span class="math-tex" data-tex=" rac{v}{\omega^{2}}\propto r^{ rac{5}{2}}" data-display="0"> rac{v}{\omega^{2}}\propto r^{ rac{5}{2}}</span>，与 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="r" data-display="0">r</span> 有关，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="v_{1}/\omega_{1}^{2}
eq v_{2}/\omega_{2}^{2}" data-display="0">v_{1}/\omega_{1}^{2}
eq v_{2}/\omega_{2}^{2}</span>，故 B 错误；<br><br>C．由以上分析可知，<span class="math-tex" data-tex=" rac{v^{2}}{\omega}\propto\sqrt{r}" data-display="0"> rac{v^{2}}{\omega}\propto\sqrt{r}</span>，与 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="r" data-display="0">r</span> 有关，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="v_{1}^{2}/\omega_{1}
eq v_{2}^{2}/\omega_{2}" data-display="0">v_{1}^{2}/\omega_{1}
eq v_{2}^{2}/\omega_{2}</span>，故 C 错误；<br><br>D．由以上分析可知，<span class="math-tex" data-tex=" rac{v^{3}}{\omega}= rac{\left( rac{GM}{r}ight)^{ rac{3}{2}}}{\sqrt{ rac{GM}{r^{3}}}}=GM" data-display="0"> rac{v^{3}}{\omega}= rac{\left( rac{GM}{r}ight)^{ rac{3}{2}}}{\sqrt{ rac{GM}{r^{3}}}}=GM</span>，与 <span class="math-tex" data-tex="r" data-display="0">r</span> 无关，故 D 正确。<br><br>故选 D。
